==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=Echelon}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|fr}} [[échelon]], from [[échelle]] 'ladder'.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈɛʃəlɒn/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈɛʃəlɑːn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[level]] or [[rank]] in an organization, profession, or society.
# {{military}} A [[formation]] of troops, ships, etc. in [[parallel]] [[row]]s with the end of each row projecting further than the one in front.

